      "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: √(2nd number + 3) = 1st number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 7 : 46\n\n⇒ √(46 + 3) = √49 = 7\n\nand 11 : 118 \n\n⇒ √(118 + 3) = √121 = 11\n\nSimilarly, for ? : 78\n\n**⇒ √(78 + 3) = √81 = 9**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
